# W30c, host c (k10): hosts Dry Land at stag0201 (New instance) and stays at the gate's arrival until b's first prompt is
# over, then goes home by the gate disc (its instance ends).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@60
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c hosts at stag0201
idle until epoch>=@270 fail stagechange
log c goes home
disk 8 until stage=stagml11,control
log c home
